{"kind":"html","caption":"把值 x 放到下标 x−1 的位置，使数组本身充当“是否出现”的标记表。示例 [3,4,-1,1] 经过两次交换变为 [1,-1,3,4]，随后从左向右检查，第二个位置不是 2，因此答案是 2。每个有效数字只会被搬到目标位置，整体时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>缺失的第一个正数</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}*{box-sizing:border-box}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}h1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.rule{color:#9cdcfe;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.45}.rule strong{color:#3794ff}.stage{min-height:auto}.indices,.cells{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.indices{margin-bottom:4px}.index{text-align:center;color:#8d8d8d;font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;width:38px}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#252526;font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;transition:.35s}.cell.active{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.cell.correct{border-color:#4ec9b0;background:#193f39}.cell.missing{border-color:#f48771;background:#572b27}.mapping{min-height:20px;text-align:center;color:#c586c0;margin-top:8px;font:12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.message{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 10px;margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;width:0}.answer{color:#f48771;font-weight:700;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>让数字回到自己的位置</h1>\n<div class=\"rule\">长度为 4 时，只关心 <strong>1 到 4</strong>。若值为 x，它应该待在下标 <strong>x − 1</strong>。</div>\n<div class=\"stage\">\n<div class=\"indices\"><div class=\"index\">下标 0</div><div class=\"index\">下标 1</div><div class=\"index\">下标 2</div><div class=\"index\">下标 3</div></div>\n<div class=\"cells\" id=\"cells\"></div>\n<div class=\"mapping\" id=\"mapping\"></div>\n<div class=\"message\" id=\"message\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#0e639c\"></i>正在处理</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#193f39\"></i>数字与位置匹配</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#572b27\"></i>发现缺失位置</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps=[\n {a:[3,4,-1,1],active:[0],map:'3 → 目标下标 2',msg:'从下标 0 开始：3 应放到下标 2。'},\n {a:[-1,4,3,1],active:[0,2],correct:[2],map:'交换下标 0 与 2',msg:'3 已归位；−1 不在 1 到 4 内，跳过。'},\n {a:[-1,4,3,1],active:[1],correct:[2],map:'4 → 目标下标 3',msg:'下标 1 的 4 应放到下标 3。'},\n {a:[-1,1,3,4],active:[1,3],correct:[2,3],map:'交换下标 1 与 3',msg:'4 已归位；当前位置换入了 1，还要继续处理。'},\n {a:[1,-1,3,4],active:[0,1],correct:[0,2,3],map:'1 → 目标下标 0',msg:'把 1 换到下标 0，排列阶段结束。'},\n {a:[1,-1,3,4],active:[0],correct:[0,2,3],map:'检查：nums[0] = 1',msg:'从左向右核对：第一个位置正确。'},\n {a:[1,-1,3,4],active:[1],correct:[0,2,3],missing:[1],map:'检查：nums[1] ≠ 2',msg:'下标 1 本应是 2，却是 −1，所以答案是 <span class=\"answer\">2</span>。'}\n];\nconst cells=document.getElementById('cells'),mapping=document.getElementById('mapping'),message=document.getElementById('message'),bar=document.getElementById('bar');\nlet s=0;\nfunction draw(){const x=steps[s];cells.innerHTML=x.a.map((v,i)=>`<div class=\"cell ${(x.active||[]).includes(i)?'active':''} ${(x.correct||[]).includes(i)?'correct':''} ${(x.missing||[]).includes(i)?'missing':''}\">${v}</div>`).join('');mapping.textContent=x.map;message.innerHTML=x.msg;bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width='0';requestAnimationFrame(()=>{bar.style.transition='width 2.2s linear';bar.style.width='100%'});}\ndraw();setInterval(()=>{s=(s+1)%steps.length;draw()},2400);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}